QuestGuidance.Register("es",103,{
[3265]="7004E63E\n1\tTalk to Authi Gem-cutter in the Quenching Trough\tAuthi Gem-cutter is in the Quenching Trough.\n2\tTalk to Khîl in the Quenching Trough\tKhîl is in the Quenching Trough, quite distraught.\n3\tTalk to Khîl and travel to his father's home\tKhîl is in the Quenching Trough, quite distraught.\n4\tTalk to Náin in the hidden chamber\tNáin is in the hidden chamber in Khîl's home in Járnfast.\n",
[3266]="70059A1E\n1\tDefeat Angmarim cultists or Trév Duvárdain in Câr Bronach ([según el diario]/8)\tVenko believes there is more to learn from the messages carried hither and yon by Angmarim cultists within Câr Bronach. He wants you to wrest from them any such missives.\n2\tDefeat Angmarim cultists or Trév Duvárdain in Câr Bronach (7/8)\tVenko believes there is more to learn from the messages carried hither and yon by Angmarim cultists within Câr Bronach. He wants you to wrest from them any such missives.\n3\tRead the orders from Magith\tYou retrieved a set of orders from one of the cultists you faced in Câr Bronach, and should read it to learn what you can of their movements and plans for the mountain passes.\n4\tBring the orders from Magith to Venko outside Tâg Fógarrach\tVenko is outside Tâg Fógarrach. No doubt the Zhélruka will be pleased to see the set of orders you recovered from the Angmarim cultist you defeated.\n5\tInvestigate the mountainside to the south-east, behind Tâg Fógarrach, and learn what could have shaken Venko's composure\tVenko saw something disturbing to the south-east, just behind Tâg Fógarrach, and he has asked you to investigate. Whatever he saw, the vision seems to have shaken the Zhélruka's composure.\n6\tSomeone watches\tVenko saw something disturbing by the mountainside to the south-east, behind Tâg Fógarrach, and he has asked you to investigate. Whatever he saw, the vision seems to have shaken the Zhélruka's composure.\n7\tTalk to Venko outside Tâg Fógarrach\tVenko is outside Tâg Fógarrach, disturbed by whatever it was he saw.\n8\tTalk to Imák south-west of Tûr Fúar\tImák is south-west of Tûr Fúar, stroking his beard thoughtfully.\n",
[3267]="70059A1F\n1\tTalk to Imák and sneak into the Drearspire of Tûr Fúar\tImák believes that the troubling presence that so disturbed Venko might be the result of a ritual being conducted by the Angmarim in Tûr Fúar, the Drearspire, and he wants you to investigate.\n2\tTalk to Venko north of the Witch-gate\tVenko is north of the Witch-gate.\n3\tReturn to the Witch-gate with Imák and Venko\tImák and Venko are prepared to depart Câr Bronach, and want to travel with you to the Witch-gate.\n4\tSomeone watches\tYou once again feel the watchful presence.\n5\tTalk to Imák at the Witch-gate\tImák stands at the Witch-gate, a haunted expression on his face.\n6\tTalk to Venko at the Witch-gate\tVenko is at the Witch-gate, waiting to speak with you about what you saw.\n",
[3268]="70047295\n1\tHabla con Bósi en el Salón bajo la Montaña\tBósi está en el Salón bajo la Montaña.\n2\tHabla con Bósi y acompáñalo para ver al rey\tBósi ha recibido instrucciones de llevarte ante el Rey bajo la Montaña.\n3\tHabla con el rey Thorin III en su trono del Salón bajo la Montaña\tThorin III, el Rey bajo la Montaña, está en su trono en Erebor.\n",
[3269]="700472B2\n1\tHabla con el rey Elessar en su sala del trono\tEl rey Elessar se encuentra en su sala del trono, en lo alto de Minas Tirith.\n2\tHabla con el rey Elessar y asiste a la ceremonia\tEl rey Elessar se encuentra en su sala del trono, en lo alto de Minas Tirith.\n3\tHabla con el rey Elessar en su sala del trono\tEl rey Elessar se encuentra en su sala del trono, en lo alto de Minas Tirith.\n",
[3270]="70025391\n1\tHabla con Radanir y viaja con él a Zudrugund\tRadanir se encuentra en el campamento de la Compañía Gris, en el bosque de árboles al este de Lhanoch. Radanir está esperando para hablar contigo, y juntos viajaréis a Zudrugund con toda prisa para intentar defenderla de los uruks de los que escribió Ergothorn. Esta misión está pensada para una comunidad. Si decides emprender esta misión en solitario, recibirás un bono de inspiración, pero el desafío será grande.\n2\tHabla con Corunir en Zudrugund\tCorunir está en Zudrugund. Has logrado repeler un ataque a Zudrugund por parte de los uruks Grishguk liderados por Nurzumgrat, y ahora deberías hablar con Corunir.\n",
[3271]="7002161F\n1\tDerrota a Ninkoth Berserker (total: 8)\030Derrota a Ninkoth Despoiler (total: 6)\030Recoge los cofres del tesoro (total: 4)\tSe pueden encontrar tesoros y uruks Ninkoth en las ruinas de Minas Elendúr y en los sótanos de Delotham. Fúni Cortagemas te espera para que recuperes la mayor cantidad de tesoros posible de las ruinas.\n2\tLleva los tesoros a Fúni Cortagemas en Minas Elendúr\tFúni Cortagemas se encuentra en Minas Elendúr. Has hecho lo que Fúni pidió y deberías regresar con él con los tesoros que has reunido.\n3\tHabla con Fúsi Cortagemas en Echad Eregion\tFúsi Cortagemas se encuentra en Echad Eregion. Has rescatado a su padre y deberías llevarle la noticia a Fúsi.\n4\tHabla con Radanir en Echad Eregion\tRadanir se encuentra en Echad Eregion. Los Rastreadores han estado discutiendo algo con Fúni Cortagemas, ahora que ha sido rescatado, y Radanir puede saber más al respecto.\n",
[3272]="700147ED\n1\tBusca el Lago Negro\030Busca encima de la sección inferior de la Escalera Interminable\tEl Lago Negro y el pie de la Escalera Interminable se encuentran entre las Fundaciones de Piedra. Lenglammel te ha pedido que busques en varios lugares alguna señal de Mithrandir o del Elfo Magor.\n2\tLleva el sombrero quemado a Lenglammel\tLenglammel se encuentra en su campamento de Gwathrendath, entre las Fundaciones de Piedra. Has buscado en ambos lugares y has encontrado el sombrero quemado de Gandalf en el medio del Lago Negro. La Escalera Interminable está bloqueada por escombros quemados y ennegrecidos. Parece que Gandalf sobrevivió lo suficiente para enfrentarse al Balrog, pero lo que pasó después es desconocido para ti. Ahora deberías hablar con Lenglammel.\n",
[3273]="7002099B\n1\tHabla con Lothrandir en Sûri-kylä\tLothrandir está en Sûri-kylä, el mayor pueblo de los Lossoth en Forochel. Calenglad te ha enviado para llevar tu mensaje a Lothrandir, en Forochel, con la advertencia de que ha vivido entre los Lossoth durante tanto tiempo que puede haber adoptado algunas de sus costumbres y personalidades.\n2\tHabla con Lothrandir y ayúdale a encontrar la sombra chillona\tLothrandir está en Sûri-kylä, en Forochel. Has entregado tu mensaje a Lothrandir, pero parece inseguro de la capacidad de la Compañía Gris para llegar a Aragorn a tiempo y quiere tu ayuda con un problema de los Lossoth.\n3\tHabla con Lothrandir en Sûri-kylä\tLothrandir está en Sûri-kylä, en Forochel. Has encontrado la causa de los problemas de caza de los Lossoth y has puesto fin a ella. Lothrandir, al menos, parece satisfecho.\n",
[3274]="7001B77F\n1\tLos nerviosos Malledhrim se encuentran por todo Audaghaim. Issuriel te ha pedido que tranquilices a los nerviosos Malledhrim por todo Audaghaim diciéndoles que todo estará bien, a pesar de las cosas perturbadoras que han visto en este pueblo abandonado.\t\n2\tHabla con Issuriel en la Posada Embrujada\tIssuriel está en el sótano de la Posada Embrujada, en Audaghaim. Has tranquilizado a un gran número de nerviosos Malledhrim y deberías volver a ver a Issuriel.\n",
[3275]="7005A723\n1\tHabla con el príncipe Ingor\tVérnozal se encuentra en Máttugard, cerca de la Escarpada. El príncipe Ingor desea hablar contigo.\n2\tHabla con el emisario de los Barbiluengos en Vérnozal\tVérnozal se encuentra en Máttugard, cerca de la Escarpada. Debes hablar con el emisario de los Barbiluengos en Vérnozal.\n3\tHabla con el príncipe Ingor\tVérnozal se encuentra en Máttugard, cerca de la Escarpada. El príncipe Ingor desea hablar contigo.\n",
[3276]="70049F32\n1\tHabla con Orophin\tDeberías hablar con Orophin y unirte al Consejo de Guerra.\n2\tHabla con Galadriel\tHabla con la Dama Galadriel para finalmente ser liberado de tu servicio.\n",
[3277]="70014647\n1\tHabla con Bori y viaja a la Sala del Mithril\tBori se encuentra en la Cámara de Liderazgo cerca de la Sala Vigesimoprimera, en Zelem-melek. Bori está esperando para hablar contigo y viajar a la Sala del Mithril, donde cree que encontrarás el hacha de mithril Zigilburk. Te pidió que trajeras aliados. NOTA: Se sugiere completar esta misión mientras estás en una comunidad. La inspiración te ayudará si decides emprender este desafío solo o con un grupo más pequeño.\n2\tHabla con Bori\tBori se encuentra en la Cámara de Liderazgo cerca de la Sala Vigesimoprimera, en Zelem-melek. Bori y tú descubrieron a Bróin, todavía vivo a pesar de las grandes dificultades, y lo trajeron sano y salvo del tesoro sumergido donde encontró el hacha de mithril Zigilburk.\n",
[3278]="70013AFD\n1\tHabla con Bósi y viaja con él para encontrar Nâr-khelab\tBósi está en la Cámara de la Encrucijada, cerca de la entrada sur del Camino de Durin, al norte de la Gran Excavación de Moria. Bósi cree que ha intuido la entrada oculta a Nâr-khelab, el Corazón de Fuego, y está esperando para viajar allí contigo.\n2\tHabla con Bósi\tBósi está en la Cámara de la Encrucijada, en la entrada sur del Camino de Durin, al norte de la Gran Excavación de Moria. Con la ayuda de Bósi, has descubierto la entrada oculta a Nâr-khelab, el Corazón de Fuego, y ahora deberías hablar con él.\n",
[3279]="7000F101\n1\tDerrota a los huargos de las sombras (total: 3)\tLos huargos de las sombras se encuentran al sur de las escaleras que suben al lago frente a la Puerta de Acebeda, del otro lado del lecho seco del Sirannon. Bróin ha encontrado la manera de endosarte esta tarea, y ahora tienes que enfrentarte a los huargos de las sombras en su lugar.\n2\tHabla con Bróin\tBróin se encuentra al pie de las escaleras que suben al lago fétido frente a la Puerta de Acebeda, al este de donde viste a Bosi. Has derrotado a un gran número de huargos de las sombras y ahora deberías volver a ver a Bróin.\n",
[3280]="70018F10\n1\tEncuentra el taller de Melkólf Tallapiedra y búscalo en busca de menciones de Zurr-thurkh\tEl pasaje al taller de Melkólf Tallapiedra se encuentra en la ladera de Zirakzigil; toma la salida oeste de la Senda Pacífica, y luego gira al oeste y sube una corta pendiente hasta la entrada. Bróin te ha pedido que encuentres el taller de Melkólf Tallapiedra y lo busques en busca de cualquier mención de Zurr-thurkh, el camino secreto hacia la sala del trono de Durin que podría haberse construido hace mucho tiempo. Ha decidido no acompañarte al taller.\n2\tHabla con Bróin\tBróin está en la Senda Pacífica, ubicada en la Sala de Reunión Militar, al este de Sulnul-dûm y al oeste de la Sala de Piedra, a lo largo del Camino de Durin. Has recuperado unos planos del taller de Melkólf Tallapiedra que revelan un camino secreto hacia Rushdurinul, la sala del trono de Durin, que ahora está ocupada por Mazog y sus orcos.\n",
[3281]="700143DD\n1\tHabla con Bori y pon en marcha su audaz plan para combatir a la Mano Blanca\tBori se encuentra en la Cámara de Liderazgo, cerca de la Sala Vigesimoprimera, en Zelem-melek. Bori te espera para dar la orden, y luego pondrá su plan en marcha.\n2\tHabla con Bori\tBori se encuentra en la Cámara de Liderazgo, cerca de la Sala Vigesimoprimera, en Zelem-melek. El plan de Bori ha sido un éxito, y ahora deberías hablar con él al respecto.\n3\tHabla con Brogur\tBrogur se encuentra con Bori en la Cámara de Liderazgo, cerca de la Sala Vigesimoprimera, en Zelem-melek. Bori está preocupado por las últimas palabras de Ashpar, y quiere que le preguntes a Brogur por consejo.\n",
[3282]="7000F100\n1\tEncuentra la causa de la locura de los lobos\030Ayuda a Bróin con la tarea que le dio Brogur\tLa causa del comportamiento temible de los lobos puede encontrarse entre sus guaridas, al sur de donde viste a Brogur y al otro lado del lecho seco del Sirannon. Brogur cree que la cueva de Filgogân podría contener alguna pista sobre la locura de los lobos, en el extremo suroeste de la región. Bróin se puede ver hablando con Bori en la base de las escaleras que suben al lago frente a la Puerta de Acebeda. Brogur te ha pedido que busques la causa de la creciente locura de los huargos de las sombras, y que ayudes a su hijo Bróin con una tarea. Cuando hayas hecho cada una de estas cosas, te dijo que hablaras con su primo Bosi.\n2\tHabla con Bósi\tBosi se encuentra al sur de donde viste a Brogur, a la vista de las escaleras que suben al lago que se extiende frente a la Puerta de Acebeda. Has aprendido algo sobre la locura de los huargos de las sombras ayudando a Bróin con su tarea, y ahora debes ir a ver a Bosi.\n",
[3283]="70047B60\n1\tHabla con Pippin\tDeberías hablar con Pippin en Bâr Thorenion y averiguar de qué tipo de 'invitación formal' están hablando él y Merry.\n2\tHabla con Merry\030Habla con Pippin\tDeberías hablar con Pippin y Merry en Bâr Thorenion.\n",
[3284]="70059A6C\n1\tTalk to Venko and travel to Maergrind\tVenko is at the Witch-gate, waiting to speak with you before the three of you depart for Maergrind, the Noble Gate.\n2\tTalk to Durin at Maergrind, the Noble Gate\tDurin is at Maergrind, enraged by both Gorgar's attack and the words of the Orc leader.\n",
[3285]="7006983B\n1\tTalk to Nauriel outside the Harbour-warden's Tower\tNauriel stands outside the Harbour-warden's Tower.\n2\tTalk to Nauriel and help her pursue the fleeing members of the Kindred\tNauriel stands outside the Harbour-warden's Tower, preparing to pursue the escaping members of the Kindred deeper into the Citadel of Winds.\n3\tTalk to Nauriel outside the Harbour-warden's Tower\tNauriel stands outside the Harbour-warden's Tower.\n4\tTalk to Sigileth outside the Harbour-warden's Tower\tSigileth stands outside the Harbour-warden's Tower.\n",
[3286]="7004E650\n1\tTalk to Khîl in the hidden chamber\tKhîl Tale-spinner is in the hidden chamber in his father's house where you discovered the Black Book of Mordor.\n2\tPick up the Black Book of Mordor from the table where it lies\tThe Black Book of Mordor is on the table in the hidden chamber in Khîl's family home in Járnfast.\n3\tTalk to Durin in the hidden chamber\tDurin is in the hidden chamber in Khîl's family home in Járnfast.\n4\tDurin wanted to meet up on the road west of Utterby to admire his handiwork.\t\n5\tCatch up to the large party heading west\tDurin has spied a large party heading west on the road to the Lonely Mountain, and he wants to investigate.\n6\tTalk to Bótuz Frostblood among the large Zhélruka force\tBótuz Frostblood leads a group of Zhélruka toward the Dale-lands.\n7\tTalk to Durin among the large Zhélruka force\tDurin stands among the group of Zhélruka that intends to cross the Dale-lands.\n8\tHurry to King Thorin in the Hall Under the Mountain\tKing Thorin III is at his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain.\n9\tTalk to King Thorin in the Hall Under the Mountain\tKing Thorin III is at his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain.\n10\tTalk to Gandalf at his chambers in the Dwelling-halls and give him the Black Book of Mordor\tGandalf is at his chambers on the upper level of the Dwelling-halls of Erebor.\n",
[3287]="70059A6E\n1\tTalk to Búkk at Maergrind\tBúkk is at Maergrind. Durin asked you to collect salves and bandages from Búkk with which to heal the hurts of those dwarves who are not already beyond help.\n2\tLongbeards and Zhélruka were wounded during Gorgar's attack, and many of them require treatment for their wounds.\t\n3\tReturn the remaining supplies to Búkk at Maergrind\tBúkk is at Maergrind. You have treated the dwarves you could, and should now return the remaining supplies to Búkk.\n4\tTalk to Durin at Maergrind\tDurin is at Maergrind, furious at Gorgar's attack and grieving for the slain.\n5\tTalk to Slagvi at Maergrind\tSlagvi is at Maergrind.\n6\tTalk to Durin at Maergrind\tDurin is at Maergrind.\n7\tTalk to Slagvi at Maergrind\tSlagvi is at Maergrind.\n",
[3288]="70069869\n1\tMeet up with Sigileth and Corudan beside the road east of the Mâkhda Khorbo\tThe ruins of the Mâkhda Khorbo stand to the north-west of Umbar Baharbêl. Sigileth and Corudan asked to meet up with you there.\n2\tTalk to Corudan beside the road east of the Mâkhda Khorbo\tCorudan stands by the road east of the Mâkhda Khorbo, north-west of Umbar Baharbêl.\n3\tTalk to Sigileth beside the road east of the Mâkhda Khorbo\tSigileth stands by the road east of the Mâkhda Khorbo, north-west of Umbar Baharbêl.\n4\tCollect rusty weapons from outside the Mâkhda Khorbo (total: 4)\030Collect finger-bones from wights near the Mâkhda Khorbo (total: 4)\030Collect gemstones from spectres or darkwaters near the Mâkhda Khorbo (total: 3)\tSigileth asked you to retrieve a number of curious objects near the Mâkhda Khorbo so she may examine them.\n5\tBring the strange items she requested to Sigileth east of the Mâkhda Khorbo\tSigileth is waiting for you to return to her east of the Mâkhda Khorbo with the strange objects for which she asked.\n6\tTalk to Corudan by his sister east of the Mâkhda Khorbo\tCorudan is beside the road east of the Mâkhda Khorbo, north-west of Umbar Baharbêl.\n7\tTalk to Rukân down the hill to the east\tCorudan has asked you to speak with a distant onlooker down the hill to the east.\n8\tTalk to Sigileth beside the road east of the Mâkhda Khorbo\tSigileth is beside the road east of the Mâkhda Khorbo, north-west of Umbar Baharbêl.\n9\tTalk to Corudan beside the road east of the Mâkhda Khorbo\tCorudan stands by the road east of the Mâkhda Khorbo, north-west of Umbar Baharbêl.\n",
[3289]="7004E651\n1\tReturn to King Thorin with Gandalf's warning about the Zhélruka\tKing Thorin is at his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain.\n2\tTalk to King Thorin in the Hall Under the Mountain\tKing Thorin is at his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain.\n3\tFind Durin on the road that climbs into the Grey Mountains\tDurin has followed the Zhélruka into the Grey Mountains, and at King Thorin's request you should look for him on the road that climbs into Ered Mithrin.\n4\tTalk to Durin on the road that climbs into the Grey Mountains\tYou have found Durin on the road that climbs into the Grey Mountains.\n",
[3290]="7004E653\n1\tDefeat enemies in the Wyrmgap (total: 8)\030Travel with Durin to the Anvil on the Withered Heath\tDurin asked you to defeat enemies in the Wyrmgap on your way to the Anvil on the Withered Heath.\n2\tTalk to Durin by the Anvil on the Withered Heath\tDurin stands by the Anvil on the Withered Heath.\n3\tCollect drake-teeth on the Withered Heath (total: 3)\030Collect worm-hides throughout Ered Mithrin (total: 6)\tDurin has asked you to defeat some of the worms and drakes that stalk the Withered Heath and Ered Mithrin, and collect their teeth and hides.\n4\tTalk to Durin by the Anvil on the Withered Heath\tDurin stands by the Anvil on the Withered Heath.\n5\tCollect hatchling-wings in Ered Mithrin (total: 4)\030Collect burning scales in Ered Mithrin (total: 4)\030Travel with Durin to the canyons south of Stormwall\tDurin asked you to defeat enemies in the Vales of Mithrin.\n6\tTalk to Durin in the canyons south of Stormwall\tDurin is in the canyons south of Stormwall.\n7\tTravel to the old fortress of Skarháld, where the Zhélruka planned to encamp\tThe old fortress of Skarháld is south and west of the path to Stormwall.\n8\tTalk to Durin at the eastern entrance of Skarháld\tThe old fortress of Skarháld is south and west of the path to Stormwall. Durin is at the eastern entrance of the city, waiting to speak with you.\n",
[3291]="70059A6F\n1\tMeet up with Slagvi at the entrance to Gloomingtarn from Deepscrave\tSlagvi asked to meet with you at the entrance to Gloomingtarn from Deepscrave, where he fears the rune-stones warding passage to that sacred cavern may be threatened.\n2\tTalk to Slagvi at the entrance to Gloomingtarn\tSlagvi stands beside the rune-stone wards at the entrance to Gloomingtarn.\n3\tStudying the stones on either side of the entrance may reveal what happened to the wards that once blocked passage to Gloomingtarn.\t\n4\tTalk to Slagvi at the entrance to Gloomingtarn\tSlagvi stands at the entrance to Gloomingtarn, beside the broken wards.\n5\tDefeat Angmarim cultists within Gloomingtarn (total: 10)\tSlagvi asked you to defeat any Angmarim cultists you find lurking within the cavern of Gloomingtarn.\n6\tTalk to Slagvi by the lakeshore\tSlagvi stands beside the lakeshore in the vast cavern, deep in thought.\n7\tLook toward the island that stands in the lake\tSlagvi has asked you to look toward the Stone of Wakening, the island that stands in the lake.\n8\tTalk to Slagvi beside the lake in Gloomingtarn\tSlagvi stands beside the lakeshore in the vast cavern, deep in thought.\n9\tCross to the island and find the White Stone Forge and the Black Stone Anvil\tThe Wakening Stone stands in the middle of the lake in Gloomingtarn.\n10\tExamine the White Stone Forge on the island in the lake\tIt is said that Durin himself constructed the White Stone Forge and the Black Stone Anvil in the days after he first awoke.\n11\tTalk to Slagvi on the Stone of Wakening\tSlagvi has come to the Stone of Wakening, and he is not happy.\n",
[3292]="7006987D\n1\tCorudan has asked you to speak with residents of the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl about Azagath and the other leaders of the Kindred that fled with him.\t\n2\tCorudan has asked you to speak with residents of the Lower Ward of Umbar Baharbêl about Azagath and the other leaders of the Kindred that fled with him.\t\n3\tGather information from residents in the Lower Ward (2/3)\tCorudan has asked you to speak with residents of the Lower Ward of Umbar Baharbêl about Azagath and the other leaders of the Kindred that fled with him.\n4\tFind the man wearing blue and silver on one of the north-south piers of the the Sail-haven\tA man in the Lower Ward told you he saw a well-dressed man in blue and silver walking along one of the north-south piers extending out into the waters of the Sail-haven, north-west of the Lower Ward.\n5\tTalk to Belondor in the Sail-haven\tBelondor stands atop one of the piers extending out into the waters of the Sail-haven.\n",
[3293]="70059A70\n1\tDefeat Angmarim in Gloomingtarn ([según el diario]/101)\tSlagvi has demanded that you slay one hundred and one Angmarim as payment for their theft of the Black Stone Anvil.\n2\tDefeat Angmarim in Gloomingtarn (6/101)\tSlagvi has demanded that you slay one hundred and one Angmarim as payment for their theft of the Black Stone Anvil.\n3\tTalk to Slagvi on the island in the lake\tSlagvi is standing on the Stone of Wakening, the island in the middle of the Gloomingtarn lake.\n4\tMeet up with Bósi and the other Longbeards on the lakeshore\tBósi and some other Longbeards have come to the lakeshore in Gloomingtarn.\n5\tTalk to Bósi on the lakeshore in Gloomingtarn\tBósi is on the lakeshore in Gloomingtarn.\n",
[3294]="7006987F\n1\tTalk to Sirgon outside the Harbour-warden's Tower, in the Sail-haven\tSirgon stands outside the Harbour-warden's Tower, in the Sail-haven.\n2\tTalk to Sirgon outside the Harbour-warden's Tower and go with him to meet with Belondor\tSirgon stands outside the Harbour-warden's Tower, in the Sail-haven, waiting to go with you to meet with Belondor.\n3\tTalk to Hármelak inside her manor\tHármelak is inside her manor, waiting to speak with you about the Kindred of the Coins.\n",
[3295]="7004E654\n1\tTalk to Bótuz Frostblood at Skarháld\tBótuz Frostblood is near the top of the fortress of Skarháld.\n2\tFind Dóbrokh at the view from the high eastern arch\030Find Inek the Brash at the siege defences\030Find Kópat inside Tharrazhâr, the keep of Skarháld\030Talk to Dóbrokh\030Talk to Inek the Brash\030Talk to Kópat\tBótuz Frostblood told you to look for his chieftains Inek, Kópat, and Dóbrokh on the upper levels of Skarháld and in the keep.\n3\tTalk to Durin inside Tharrazhâr, the keep of Skarháld\tDurin is inside Tharrazhâr, the keep of Skarháld.\n4\tLeave the keep of Skarháld and learn what transpired outside\tYou heard raised voices outside the keep. What is happening?\n5\tTalk to Vútro the West-wind and learn how he was injured\tA crowd of dwarves surround a wounded Zhélruka warrior on the upper level of Skarháld.\n",
